FFmpeg: this repository bundles a prebuilt FFmpeg command-line binary
(ffmpeg.exe at the repository root) used for audio decoding. The bundled
binary is FFmpeg 7.1.1, built from the unmodified upstream release, and is
licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later
(LGPL-2.1-or-later). No GPL or non-free components are enabled: the build
does not use --enable-gpl, --enable-nonfree, or --enable-version3, and
external libraries are disabled. The binary is invoked as a separate process
and is not linked into Vocal2Midi. The license text, exact build recipe, and
the written offer for the corresponding source code are in
third_party/ffmpeg/.

